---
import DevLayout from "../components/dev-layout.astro";
import { DitherSequence } from "../components/dither-sequence.tsx";
---

<DevLayout title="Dither sequence">
  <p slot="lead" class="max-w-2xl text-muted-foreground">
    Twelve photos from Paper. Dithering builds with each frame while the branches, leaves and sky stay recognizable.
    Compare three prepared treatments with the originals, or choose Live shader to explore the Ambar palette and adjust the filter yourself.
  </p>
  <DitherSequence client:load />
  <p class="max-w-2xl text-sm text-muted-foreground">
    Exported with Paper's Image Dithering filter. Each treatment increases the pixel size and filter blend while reducing color steps.
    Prepared treatments play WebP images. Live shader runs Paper's ImageDithering in the browser and lets you download the settings for all twelve frames.
    This experiment is available only in development.
  </p>
</DevLayout>
